### **Goal Model Tables**

---

#### **Goals Table**

| Name       | Title                          | Text                                                                 | Runtime                      | Goal Type | Relation |
|------------|--------------------------------|----------------------------------------------------------------------|------------------------------|-----------|----------|
| G1         | Fulfill Resource Request       | A robot must collect resources from storage and deliver them to the requesting agent. | `;` (sequential)             | Perform   | AND      |
| G2         | Collect Resources from Storage | The robot must visit storage locations in order of waiting time and path. | `#` (parallel)               | Perform   | AND      |
| G3         | Deliver Resources to Agent     | The robot must deliver all resources to the requesting agent's location. | `;` (sequential)             | Perform   | AND      |
| G4         | Navigate to Storage            | The robot must travel to a specific storage location.                   | `-` (leaf)                   | Perform   | AND      |
| G5         | Request Resource from Storage  | The robot must request the specified resource from the storage.       | `-` (leaf)                   | Perform   | AND      |
| G6         | Wait for Resource Retrieval    | The robot waits until the resource is retrieved from the storage.     | `-` (leaf)                   | Perform   | AND      |
| G7         | Navigate to Delivery Location  | The robot must travel to the requesting agent's location.             | `-` (leaf)                   | Perform   | AND      |
| G8         | Deliver Resources              | The robot delivers the collected resources to the requesting agent.   | `-` (leaf)                   | Perform   | AND      |
| G9         | Return to Recharging Station   | If battery is low during collection, the robot returns to recharge.   | `FALLBACK(AT6, AT7)`         | Perform   | OR       |
| G10        | Return to Checkpoint           | If battery is low during delivery, the robot returns to a checkpoint. | `FALLBACK(AT8, AT9)`         | Perform   | OR       |

