#### **Tasks Table**

| Name     | Title                        | Text                                                                 | Relation | Location         | Number of Robots |
|----------|------------------------------|----------------------------------------------------------------------|----------|------------------|------------------|
| AT1      | Navigate to Storage A        | Robot travels to Storage A.                                          | AND      | Storage A        | [1]              |
| AT2      | Request Resource from A      | Robot requests the specified resource from Storage A.                | AND      | Storage A        | [1]              |
| AT3      | Wait for Retrieval at A      | Robot waits until the resource is retrieved from Storage A.          | AND      | Storage A        | [1]              |
