| AT5      | Deliver Resources            | Robot delivers resources to the requesting agent.                    | AND      | Requesting Agent | [1]              |
| AT6      | Return to Recharging Station | Robot returns to the recharging station due to low battery.          | OR       | Recharging Station | [1]              |
| AT7      | Assign Task to Another Robot | The mission is reassigned to another robot after returning to charge. | OR       | Control Center   | [1]              |
