| AT9      | Assign Remaining Task        | The remaining task is reassigned to another robot after checkpoint.  | OR       | Control Center   | [1]              |
| AT10     | Trigger Alert                | If resource cannot be returned to checkpoint, alert the sector manager. | OR       | Control Center   | [1]              |

